        ["macOS 把它叫“屏幕与系统音频录制”。允许后，系统可能要求重新打开应用，引导会保留进度。"] = "macOS calls it “Screen & System Audio Recording”. After you allow it, the system may ask you to reopen the app; the guide keeps your progress.",
