        ["一个模板就是若干部分，每部分有名字和一句给 AI 的要求。可以从现有模板复制一份再改；每个场景用哪个模板，在“场景”页选。"] = "A template is a set of sections, each with a name and a one-line instruction for the AI. Copy an existing template and edit it. Which template each scene uses is chosen on the Scenes page.",
