        ["下面列出实际安装状态；“已安装”表示文件已校验，识别方式是否启用以上方选择为准。"] = "Actual installation status is shown below. “Installed” means the files were verified; use the selector above to choose whether recognition is enabled.",
        ["下面是 ScreenCaptureKit 截取的整个屏幕，与 Zoom、Teams、Meet 等共享整屏时可能捕获的范围相近。如果能看到回答浮窗，整屏共享时其他参与者也可能看到；实际范围取决于会议软件和共享方式。"] = "This is a full-screen capture through ScreenCaptureKit, similar to what Zoom, Teams, Meet, and other apps may capture when you share your screen. If the answer window is visible here, other participants may also see it during full-screen sharing. The exact capture area depends on the meeting app and sharing method.",
        ["下面是用 ScreenCaptureKit 截取整个屏幕的结果，与 Zoom / Teams / Meet 等共享整屏时的取图方式相同。如果能看到提词器，说明共享整屏时对方也可能看到；请改为只共享会议窗口或标签页。"] = "This is the whole screen captured with ScreenCaptureKit, the way Zoom, Teams or Meet capture a shared screen. If you can see the teleprompter here, others may see it when you share your entire screen; share only the meeting window or tab instead.",
        ["不使用麦克风 · 只记录对方的声音"] = "No microphone · only the other side is recorded",
        ["不使用麦克风，也不会询问权限。会议里只记录对方的声音。"] = "The microphone isn't used and won't ask for access. Only the other side is recorded.",
