        ["不可用（转写数据无法读取）"] = "Unavailable (transcript could not be read)",
        ["不启用：按关键词查找，无需下载或建索引，准备快；同义问法可能漏检。\n启用：模型加共用组件最多约 835 MB，先在本机建索引，额外占内存；能补充按含义查找，但仍可能漏检。\n两者都只把相关片段带入回答，并非“关闭向量就发送全文”。全量发送资料会增加等待与用量，也可能超过上下文上限。共用组件只需安装一次。"] = "Off: finds materials by keyword with no download or indexing, so setup is quick; equivalent phrasing may be missed.\nOn: the model and shared components use up to about 835 MB. An index is built on this Mac and uses extra memory. Meaning-based search can help but may still miss results.\nBoth options include only relevant excerpts in answers; turning off vector search does not send full documents. Sending all materials would increase wait time and usage and may exceed context limits. Shared components are installed only once.",
        ["不开会时，鼠标停在刘海上可以直接开始一场"] = "Outside meetings, rest the pointer on the notch to start one",
        ["不戴耳机时对方的声音会从扬声器传进麦克风；应用比对两路音频的节奏和文字，回声不记为“我”。戴耳机始终最干净。"] = "Without headphones, speaker audio can enter the microphone. The app compares timing and text so echoes are not attributed to you. Headphones provide the cleanest result.",
        ["不戴耳机时对方的声音会从扬声器传进麦克风；应用比对两路音频，回声不记为“我”。"] = "Without headphones, the other side's voice comes out of the speakers and into the microphone. The app compares the two audio paths, and echo isn't recorded as “Me”.",
        ["不打扰，安静地记。结束后自动整理纪要。"] = "Stays out of the way and takes notes. Notes are written when you end.",
        ["不挑场合，立即记录"] = "Any occasion, record right away",
        ["不是同一个系列"] = "Not the same series",
        ["不是我"] = "Not me",
        ["不用的可以关掉"] = "Turn off what you don’t need",
        ["不用麦克风，只记录电脑里播放的声音。以后可在设置 → 高级 → 声音与识别 重新打开。"] = "No microphone; only the sound your computer plays is recorded. You can turn it back on later in Settings → Advanced → Sound and recognition.",
        ["不确定的句子交给 API 模型二次判断"] = "Use the API model to recheck uncertain sentences",
