        ["先录下来，其他的之后再说"] = "Record first, sort out the rest later",
        ["先打开上面的屏幕读取，才能认出演示文稿翻到了哪一页。"] = "Turn on screen reading above first, so it can tell which slide you are on.",
        ["先扫描本机已有的兼容文档模型与支持组件，校验后复用，保留原文件。无需重复下载，也不会自动启用 OCR 或语义检索。"] = "Scan for compatible document models and components already on this Mac. Verified files are reused in place; OCR and semantic retrieval are not enabled automatically.",
        ["先新增经验或题目后即可编辑"] = "Add a lesson or question before editing.",
        ["先查看新增、相同和冲突内容；确认所选内容后才会应用。冲突默认保留本机，应用前创建恢复点。"] = "Review new, identical and conflicting content before applying selected changes. Conflicts keep the local copy by default, and a recovery point is created first.",
        ["先添加资料，AI 才能读出重点。"] = "Add materials first so AI has something to read.",
        ["先用系统识别"] = "Use system recognition first",
        ["先看看"] = "Look around first",
        ["先立刻给出快速回答；需要最新信息（价格、新闻、版本、现任人员、“今天 / 最近”…）时在后台联网，通常 5–20 秒后自动换成联网版，可随时切回原回答。“自动判断”用本地规则。"] = "A quick answer appears first. For current information, search runs in the background and usually replaces it after 5–20 seconds. You can return to the original answer. Automatic selection uses local rules.",
        ["先聊聊你简历里的检索项目。上周加入重排之后，结果怎么样？"] = "Let's talk about the retrieval project on your resume. How did the results look after you added reranking last week?",
        ["先连接回答服务"] = "Connect an answer engine first",
        ["先连接回答服务，才能整理纪要"] = "Connect an answer service to write notes",
        ["先选一个最常用的场合。每个场合有自己的提示和纪要，开会前随时可以换。"] = "Pick the scene you use most. Each scene has its own prompts and notes, and you can switch before any meeting.",
        ["先选线上或线下；语音识别准备好即可记录，不需要先配置 AI。"] = "Choose online or in person. Once transcription is ready, you can record without setting up AI.",
        ["免 OCR 模型权重，读取原文件。需要已登录的 Codex、共用组件和网络；占账号额度，速度受网络影响。"] = "Reads original files without OCR weights. Requires a signed-in Codex account, shared components and network access; uses account allowance.",
