        ["共享整块屏幕时，系统不再让应用把自己排除在外，提词岛只能靠自动收回；其他软件先点测试看一眼。%@ 可随时隐藏全部窗口。"] = "When you share an entire screen, macOS no longer lets an app exclude itself, so the cue island can only withdraw on its own. Run the test first if you use other software. %@ hides all windows at any time.",
        ["共享某个窗口或另一块屏幕时，提词岛不在画面里。共享它所在的整块屏幕时，macOS 15.4 起系统不再让应用把自己排除在外，所以提词岛会在识别到 Zoom、Teams、腾讯会议、飞书、钉钉或 Webex 的整屏共享后自动收起；其他软件请先用下面的测试看一眼。%@ 可随时隐藏全部窗口。"] = "The cue island is not in the picture when you share a window or another screen. Since macOS 15.4 an app can no longer exclude itself when its whole screen is shared, so the island withdraws when it detects a full-screen share from Zoom, Teams, Tencent Meeting, Feishu, DingTalk or Webex. For other apps, check with the test below first. %@ hides all windows at any time.",
